<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Three killed in S.African jail fight.</title>
<headline>Three killed in S.African jail fight.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three prisoners were killed and 21 wounded on Saturday in a gang fight in a South African jail, a prison spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the fight broke out at Upington jail in the Northern Cape. &quot;The situation is tense but under control,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
